Alembic migrations for the serving tables (ADR 0008). The tables are defined in build/tables.py.

Change a table: edit build/tables.py, then generate and review a migration against a database at the current head:

    AXONARIUM_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://... uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "what changed"

Apply: `uv run alembic upgrade head`. CI runs `alembic check`, which fails if build/tables.py and the migrations differ.
